            "en": "A common fix is to move the boundary method into another cohesive bean and call it through that bean's proxy, or redesign the transaction boundary. Self-injecting the proxy or retrieving it from AopContext increases coupling and should be a controlled exception. AspectJ weaving does not share the same proxy boundary but adds complexity."
