            "zh": "HandlerMapping 找处理器，HandlerAdapter 适配调用方式，ArgumentResolver 解析参数，HttpMessageConverter 读写 body，HandlerExceptionResolver 处理异常。Interceptor 的 pre/post/afterCompletion 围绕 handler，但不覆盖进入 DispatcherServlet 前的工作。",
            "en": "HandlerMapping selects a handler, HandlerAdapter adapts its invocation, argument resolvers produce parameters, HttpMessageConverters read and write bodies, and HandlerExceptionResolvers process failures. An interceptor's pre, post, and after-completion callbacks surround the handler but do not cover work before DispatcherServlet."
