            "en": "Use `@ControllerAdvice` or `@RestControllerAdvice` with `@ExceptionHandler` to map known failures to stable HTTP statuses and error structures. For unknown failures, log a correlation ID and return a generic 5xx response without exposing stack traces or internals."
