            "en": "Their coverage and exception paths differ. A Filter sees requests that never reach a Controller. An Interceptor can inspect HandlerMethod. AOP can cover non-HTTP entry points but only through proxy interception. Tracing often establishes entry context in a Filter and adds service spans through instrumentation or AOP."
