            "labelEn": "Deep dive",
            "zh": "Boot 与嵌入服务器可配置 graceful shutdown 和生命周期超时，但完整流程还取决于负载均衡摘流延迟、Kubernetes preStop/terminationGracePeriod、后台消费者与自建线程池是否受容器管理。幂等和重试应覆盖被终止的请求。",
            "en": "Boot and its embedded server can configure graceful shutdown and lifecycle timeout, but the full path also depends on load-balancer drain delay, Kubernetes preStop and terminationGracePeriod, background consumers, and whether custom executors are container-managed. Idempotency and retries must cover requests interrupted at termination."
