            "en": "Actuator provides operational endpoints such as health, metrics, env, configprops, loggers, and threaddump. Expose only necessary endpoints in production, protect them with a separate management network or port, authentication and authorization, and redaction, and never publish sensitive diagnostics openly on the Internet."
