            "labelZh": "追问",
            "labelEn": "Follow-up",
            "zh": "catch 后为了记录日志再抛出，是否重复日志？边界层记录一次带完整上下文即可，中间层可添加 cause/业务信息但不要层层打印。",
            "en": "Should every layer catch, log, and rethrow? No. Log once at the boundary that owns handling, with complete context. Intermediate layers may add a cause or domain context without printing the same stack repeatedly."
