            "en": "Common causes include an object that is not a Spring bean, a call that bypasses the proxy, self-invocation, a method or class that the current proxy strategy cannot intercept, a swallowed exception, a non-transactional database engine, incorrect propagation or transaction-manager selection, and an asynchronous thread switch."
