            "en": "Diagnose by checking the actual bean type and proxy, invocation entry, transaction logs and connection autocommit, exception propagation, and final commit point. Restrictions around private or final methods depend on proxy type and Spring version, but a clear public service boundary is the most reliable place for a transaction."
