            "en": "Insert a placeholder first or record it in the same transaction as the business write. A repeated key must compare the request fingerprint: return the stored result for the same completed request, a clear in-progress state while processing, and a conflict for different input. Define TTL, tenant scope, retryable failure states, and concurrent-wait behavior."
